FizzBuzz in Brainfuck — Algorithm:
  1. Memory layout: tape cells hold ASCII for "Fizz", "Buzz", digits 0-9, newline
  2. Outer loop counts 1..100, incrementing tens/ones digits
  3. Multiples of 3 → print "Fizz" (cells 0-3)
  4. Multiples of 5 → print "Buzz" (cells 4-7)  
  5. Otherwise → print decimal number (cells 8-17)
  6. Print newline and continue
  Pure Brainfuck, no extensions needed.

